 "decisions": {
  "cut_1": "Sort compact addresses once; join every payload once on the compact (occurrence_id, position) side; spill joined rows into LZ4 Arrow IPC files per window of a sixteenth of the allowance; sort each window in memory and rejoin member keys. Same rows, order, bytes and batch boundaries; one entity scan; O(P).",
