  "cut_6": "Keep ENGINE_THREADS = 1. At four threads the gate fails test_parquet_arrow_stream (both cases) and the bulk revision test: DuckDB pulls Python-fed Arrow streams on worker threads and lazy SQLite sources refuse. The one-pass read gains nothing from threads (16.04 s vs 16.34 s); the rewrite gains 2.7x.",
  "next_step": "Pull registered Python streams on the caller thread in bounded batches: records.py:627 (_incoming), core_selections.py:257 and :335, core_states.py:792 (changed_keys); then raise the default for DuckDB-bound work. The ordered read would also need its Arrow routing parallelized.",
  "gate_at_four_threads": "10 failed, 1572 passed, 1 skipped (3 from thread affinity, 1 from 32 MiB at four threads, 5 from the shared relation view name since fixed, 1 pre-existing on main)"
 },
